<title>HONG KONG: Tianjin Bohai interim net down 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Tianjin Bohai interim net down 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		     0.036    vs 0.059</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)		nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	    7.89     vs nil</p>
<p>    Net				47.72    vs 74.57</p>
<p>    Turnover			 1,419.08 vs 1,390.80</p>
<p>    Company name		   Tianjin Bohai Chemical Industry</p>
<p>					 (Group) Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		    N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	     N/A</p>
